      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Settlement around Mahtowa Station began in 1875, drawing workers and families linked to the booming timber trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/mahtowa_minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mahtowa Township was organized on September 26, 1870, as part of Carlton County’s early civil divisions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
