      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/mahtowa_minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1888, the Paul & Duluth Railroad’s Mahtowa Station housed a sawmill, about 20 homes, and a large stock farm.",
